SEL: fixed parsing of RTAC and SEL-3620 web pages: the Sequence of Events log (``soe.csv``) is read with the ``csv`` module, logons with ``log_on`` and the firmware and project in RTAC start messages are classified correctly (older messages in the log no longer replace the current firmware), RTAC memory and storage sizes are stored in bytes instead of KB, a failed diagnostics page no longer fails the RTAC dashboard (and verification), and SEL-3620 certificate exports with absolute links download the certificate instead of the base page (links to other hosts are skipped).
